---
import { featuredProjects } from '../data/projects';
---
<div class="atlas-shell" data-atlas-shell>
  <canvas class="atlas-canvas" data-atlas-canvas tabindex="0" aria-label="Interactive three-dimensional project archipelago. Enter explore mode to steer the panda captain."></canvas>
  <div class="atlas-fallback" data-atlas-fallback hidden>
    <span>✦</span>
    <p>The interactive sea could not be rendered, but every project remains available below.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="atlas-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="atlas-vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="atlas-labels">
    {featuredProjects.map((project) => (
      <a class="atlas-label" href={`/projects/${project.slug}/`} data-project-label={project.slug}>
        <span class="atlas-label-dot" style={`--project-color:${project.color}`}></span>
        <span>{project.title}</span>
      </a>
    ))}
  </div>

  <div class="atlas-hud">
    <div class="atlas-coordinates" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>THE BUILDER'S ATLAS</span>
      <span>19.4326° N · 99.1332° W</span>
    </div>

    <button id="atlas-fullscreen" class="atlas-icon-button atlas-fullscreen-button" type="button" aria-label="Open atlas in fullscreen" title="Fullscreen">⛶</button>

    <div class="atlas-controls">
      <button id="atlas-play" class="atlas-button" type="button" aria-pressed="false">
        <span class="atlas-button-icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</span>
        <span data-play-label>Explore the sea</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <p id="atlas-status" class="atlas-status" aria-live="polite">Select an island, or open explore mode to steer the panda.</p>

    <div class="atlas-help" id="atlas-help" hidden>
      <button id="atlas-help-close" type="button" aria-label="Close controls guide">×</button>
      <p class="atlas-help-kicker">Captain controls</p>
      <strong>Move like a small boat, not a car.</strong>
      <div class="atlas-help-grid">
        <span><kbd>W</kbd><kbd>↑</kbd><b>Advance</b></span>
        <span><kbd>S</kbd><kbd>↓</kbd><b>Reverse</b></span>
        <span><kbd>A</kbd><kbd>←</kbd><b>Turn left</b></span>
        <span><kbd>D</kbd><kbd>→</kbd><b>Turn right</b></span>
      </div>
      <p>Use the joystick on touch devices. Sail into an island—or select its label—to open the case study. Use the mouse wheel to adjust the camera.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="atlas-docking-notice" id="atlas-docking-notice" hidden aria-live="assertive">
      <span>Docking at</span>
      <strong data-docking-title></strong>
      <small>Opening case study…</small>
    </div>

    <div class="atlas-speed" aria-hidden="true">
      <span>THROTTLE</span>
      <b data-atlas-speed>00</b>
    </div>

    <div class="atlas-joystick" data-atlas-joystick aria-label="Virtual joystick for the panda ship" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="atlas-joystick-base" data-joystick-base>
        <span class="atlas-joystick-knob" data-joystick-knob></span>
      </div>
      <small>Joystick · drag to sail</small>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  import '../scripts/pirateAtlas';
</script>
